or 1941 (annual average)\n# The official rate was \\$4.03 per British pound\nexchange_rate_1941 = 4.03\nprint(f'6. 1941 annual average USD/GBP exchange rate: {exchange_rate_1941}')\n\n# Step 7: Divide percentage by exchange rate\nresult = percentage / exchange_rate_1941\nprint(f'7. Result before rounding: {result}')\n\n# Step 8: Round to 4 decimal places\nfinal = round(result, 4)\nprint(f'8. Final answer (rounded to 4 decimal places): {final}')\n\""}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
